<title>BELGIUM: AUXIMINES 1996 PROFIT SOARS.</title>
<headline>AUXIMINES 1996 PROFIT SOARS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in million Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit (ex-minorities)    388  vs     11</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			 1,482  vs  1,291</p>
<p>    Net capital gains		     1,338  vs    816</p>
<p>    Cons dividend income		    752  vs    595</p>
<p>    Gross dividend (francs/share)   533.33   vs   466.67</p>
<p>NOTE - Auximines is a Belgian holding company. </p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
